{"title": "Broken spear", "pageid": 27910, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Broken_spear", "categories": ["Weapons"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Broken spear</b> refers the following two items that can be obtained in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Wilderness\" title=\"Wilderness\">Wilderness</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Head_of_a_Broken_Spear\" title=\"Head of a Broken Spear\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Head_of_a_Broken_Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Head_of_a_Broken_Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Head_of_a_Broken_Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Head_of_a_Broken_Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Head_of_a_Broken_Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Head_of_a_Broken_Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Head_of_a_Broken_Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Head_of_a_Broken_Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Head_of_a_Broken_Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Head_of_a_Broken_Spear\" title=\"Head of a Broken Spear\">Head of a Broken Spear</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shaft_of_a_Broken_Spear\" title=\"Shaft of a Broken Spear\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Shaft_of_a_Broken_Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shaft_of_a_Broken_Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Shaft_of_a_Broken_Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Shaft_of_a_Broken_Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Shaft_of_a_Broken_Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Shaft_of_a_Broken_Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Shaft_of_a_Broken_Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shaft_of_a_Broken_Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Shaft_of_a_Broken_Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shaft_of_a_Broken_Spear\" title=\"Shaft of a Broken Spear\">Shaft of a Broken Spear</a></span></li></ul>\n<p>When combined, the following item can be obtained:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vision_of_the_Absolute\" title=\"Vision of the Absolute\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Vision_of_the_Absolute_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Vision_of_the_Absolute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Vision_of_the_Absolute_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Vision_of_the_Absolute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Vision_of_the_Absolute_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Vision_of_the_Absolute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Vision_of_the_Absolute_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Vision_of_the_Absolute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Vision_of_the_Absolute_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Vision_of_the_Absolute\" title=\"Vision of the Absolute\">Vision of the Absolute</a></span>: Deals extr